From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Florent Revest <revestflo@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 13:34:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Remove the libdsme dependency entirely

AsteroidOS no longer ships dsme, so mce can no longer talk to it. Drop
libdsme from mce: synthesize the USER system state at init (dsme used to
feed it, and display/keypad/tklock are gated on it), route reboot/shutdown
through systemctl, and drop the thermalmanager D-Bus monitor.
---
 Makefile   |   2 -
 mce-dbus.c |   5 -
 mce-dsme.c | 989 ++++-------------------------------------------------
 3 files changed, 69 insertions(+), 927 deletions(-)

