+ * AsteroidOS note
+ *
+ * AsteroidOS does not run the dsme daemon. This module used to keep a
+ * socket to dsme for the device runlevel/state, a process watchdog and
+ * thermal notifications; all of that is gone (and libdsme with it). What
+ * remains here is the minimum the rest of mce still relies on:
+ *
+ *   - Assume MCE_SYSTEM_STATE_USER at startup. Nothing else feeds the
+ *     system state now, and the display / tklock / input state machines
