+ *   - Keep the system_state -> LED pattern / transition-submode /
+ *     shutting-down glue, so any state change we drive ourselves behaves
+ *     as it did before.
+ *   - Clear MCE_SUBMODE_TRANSITION once init_done goes true. init_done is
+ *     fed independently by the display flag-file watcher, so this still
+ *     works without dsme.
+ *   - Route reboot / shutdown requests to systemd.
+ * ------------------------------------------------------------------------
  */
 
